{{trans-bottom}}

====Usage notes====
A ''comeuppance'' is invariably a bad experience. Even so, some dictionaries leave open the possibility of a positive outcome, either explicitly in the definition or by using synonyms such as {{term|just deserts}}, which can be positive.

